  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.39 - Anima: the DiT (Cosmos-Predict2-2B MiniTrainDIT), its LLM adapter and ControlNet-LLLite v2 (inpainting), checked against ComfyUI to 1e-5 (SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML.Anima). Fixed: NaN from the precise CUDA attention when k and v are separate blocks. The models-host mirror index is read again after a failed read (it was kept for the life of the process). UnigramTokenizer reads tokenizer.json files without model.type (older T5 format).",
